      "control_name": "SageMaker Pipeline Role Must Follow Least Privilege",
      "control_description": "SageMaker pipeline execution roles must be scoped to the minimum permissions required for the pipeline steps. An overprivileged role lets any pipeline step — including steps that process untrusted input — access resources beyond the pipeline's scope: reading secrets, deploying models to production, or modifying IAM policies.\n",
